---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="简历" active="resume">
  <div class="resume">
    <aside class="resume-aside">
      <h1>董东华</h1>
      <p class="role">计算机相关专业 · 求职方向待填写</p>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2>联系方式</h2>
        <ul class="contact-list">
          <li>邮箱：xindongsh@163.com</li>
          <li>GitHub：<span class="todo">待补充链接</span></li>
          <li>电话：<span class="todo">待补充</span></li>
          <li>所在地：<span class="todo">待补充</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2>专业技能</h2>
        <ul class="skill-list">
          <li>C / C++：数据结构与算法、STL、常用算法设计</li>
          <li>算法：动态规划、最短路、搜索、二分、RMQ 等</li>
          <li>工具：Git、VS Code、Linux 基础命令</li>
          <li>Web：HTML / CSS / JavaScript 基础 <span class="todo">按实际情况增删</span></li>
          <li>英语：<span class="todo">四六级 / 分数</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-section no-print">
        <h2>快捷操作</h2>
        <ul class="contact-list">
          <li><a href="javascript:window.print()">打印 / 导出 PDF</a></li>
          <li><a href="/">返回首页</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </aside>

    <div>
      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2>个人简介</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--ink-2);">
          热爱编程与算法，习惯用写代码的方式解决问题，也喜欢把学习过程和日常生活记录下来。
          <span class="todo">用 2～3 句话补充你的介绍：性格特点、专注方向、想做的事。</span>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2>教育背景</h2>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3><span class="todo">学校名称</span></h3>
          <p class="when"><span class="todo">专业 · 学历</span> ｜ <span class="todo">2023.09 – 2027.06</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li>主修课程：<span class="todo">填写 3～5 门相关课程</span></li>
            <li>GPA / 排名：<span class="todo">如 3.8 / 4.0，专业前 10%</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2>项目与竞赛经历</h2>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3><span class="todo">项目 / 竞赛名称</span></h3>
          <p class="when"><span class="todo">担任角色</span> ｜ <span class="todo">时间</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li><span class="todo">项目背景与你要解决的问题</span></li>
            <li><span class="todo">你的具体工作：用了什么技术、做了什么优化</span></li>
            <li><span class="todo">结果：性能提升 xx%、获得 xx 奖项 / 名次</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3><span class="todo">第二个项目</span></h3>
          <p class="when"><span class="todo">角色</span> ｜ <span class="todo">时间</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li><span class="todo">按「背景 → 做法 → 结果」三段式补充</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2>荣誉与证书</h2>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <p class="when"><span class="todo">时间</span></p>
          <ul>
            <li><span class="todo">奖项 / 证书名称</span></li>
            <li><span class="todo">继续添加</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2>自我评价</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--ink-2);">
          <span class="todo">写 2～3 条，每条一句话，避免空话套话，最好能对应上面的经历。</span>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
